# PyMS $param_given fix — corrects BSIM-CMG low-Vg sign inversion.
# Root cause: JIT baked ALL params into param_values; emitter used
# param_values.keys() as the $param_given set, so defaulted params
# (NVTM, THETASCE/SW/DIBL) read as user-given -> nVtm=NVTM=0 ->
# every /nVtm term hit pole_error, swallowed to 0 by _safe_ex ->
# frozen surface-potential solve -> negative subthreshold qis.
# Fix: shell emits __GIVEN__= from Xyce given(); builder parses it;
# emitter takes a real given_params set (PSP103 uses $param_given 0x).
# Generated 2026-09-18T23:15:12Z

